# Scratch written into the repo root during assistant sessions.
#
# Never part of the plugin: `package.json#files` is an allow-list so it cannot
# reach the zip, and it is untracked so it cannot reach SVN. Ignored anyway
# because the space in its name is what Plugin Check fails a distributable on,
# and one `git add .` is the whole distance between harmless and fatal.
Claude outputs/

